{"unit_id":"1a125__dsh-bili-chat-whale#caveat-1","repo":"1a125/dsh-bili-chat-whale","commit":"d4d8db7ba258f434db5b8d7cb88ee365a4686f9c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"聊天鲸 使用前须知：默认支持本地语音识别，但首次使用可能需要下载约 240MB 的识别模型；HTTP 视觉服务为可选路径，配置后截图会发送到所选服务。见 lib/asr.js:13-14、lib/vision.js:9-11。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/asr.js:13-14","lib/vision.js:9-11"]}
